  "The print-and-play holds 5 leader cards and 12 decision cards (the rules' Contents list). Base-game components the rules name (Wonder cards, Coins, Progress tokens, military pawn, game board) belong to 7 Wonders Duel and are not in these files, so they are not added to rules_items.",
  "Each of 13 unique designs (pixel-identical fronts grouped) was read by independent single-component model calls until every value had a majority; 12 designs were unanimous, 0 were resolved by hand.",
